{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_02_010_23_5_02_010_23",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:18dac196c0884c22e9645cf22594680798609e531497480b558af1329670a254",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_02_010_23_5_02_010_23:5_02_010_23:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:72b1164f67de96750cc28e2ad9f0eb3b32dd008946093721275b52890956082c",
      "text": "制作人，白色情人节快乐！\n这个，给你！是我的心意！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_010_23_5_02_010_23:5_02_010_23:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e75883ee71d837a41d554f1e77a2ef7c8b0b755c28b44f5b4cae2333ab5c0db0",
      "text": "非常感谢！……邀请函，吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_010_23_5_02_010_23:5_02_010_23:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35cac9975e858635a14e3633b02938de18f6b19c9d7523f8ddaaaad69c107db7",
      "text": "嗯！制作方法，是实和恭二教我的。\n地图，我也画了哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_010_23_5_02_010_23:5_02_010_23:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1de9869b984d9b33ff3f5189f3a079fb929cdc3553b85f27043c87f183015c6a",
      "text": "情人节的谢礼，想了好多好多。\n点心，之前也一起吃过了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_010_23_5_02_010_23:5_02_010_23:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d49da8dbdcba2399817807c625f40cfac4d60197c21328188734c1376ca719e3",
      "text": "我住的酒店，在办下午茶！\n只有现在，特别期间。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_010_23_5_02_010_23:5_02_010_23:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2a55e9e54e2bb31ddf290130b3980917f8e2c5d85d95cc179a1608a95fef2f3c",
      "text": "所以，制作人，和我一起去好吗？\n在一起的话，会更加开心。之前说过！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_010_23_5_02_010_23:5_02_010_23:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:063837b1b05ba20810d8835180b2141b07c86261a0aa418eacf10b1d80d7e318",
      "text": "好的，非常乐意。\n和皮埃尔先生在一起的话开心翻倍哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_010_23_5_02_010_23:5_02_010_23:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b1d2d2aa27ca26536c814d59383ae1d41903c35f54f2a29bf74fe7097a58076",
      "text": "呀呼——！一起去，约好了哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_010_23_5_02_010_23:5_02_010_23:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9af7d3c4dc49e625d244f82b85675e3d0199d0fa2b3795c4cf5738ec59c71629",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー，日程，清楚吗？\n我，去预约。交给我！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_010_23_5_02_010_23:5_02_010_23:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:476b71e9b5e680af8c4e80011f6dc693752516666a75e7d626dc15d8462fd678",
      "text": "好的，我确认好日程之后稍后联系你哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_02_010_23_5_02_010_23:5_02_010_23:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:31961f6879bceff9c01d0860d0059dcaefe325056e19367183056de112d92b0b",
      "text": "嗯，等着你！\n那么，工作加油吧——！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
